--!strict
--[[
    ============================================================
    PET UNIVERSE HUB — by SlenderHub
    ------------------------------------------------------------
    Jogo   : Pet Universe (framework Knit)
    Dump   : slenderhub/dumps/Pet Universe (Dex + Remotes)
    UI     : Fluent (dawid-scripts/Fluent)
    ------------------------------------------------------------
    REMOTES MAPEADOS (via ReplicatedStorage.Packages.Knit.Services):
      BreakableOrbService.RE.ClaimOrb        (zona, tier, dano, coinId)
      BreakableOrbService.RE.ClaimClickBonus (coinId)
      BreakableAreaService.RE.SetAutoBreaking(bool)
      BreakableSpawnService.RE.ReportDestroyed(zona, coinId)
      EggHatchService.RE.Hatch               (ovo, "Max" | quantidade)
      EggHatchService.Config                 ("Delete", petName)
    ------------------------------------------------------------
    CICLO DO FARM (exploit):
      1) ReportDestroyed(zona, coinId) em todos os breakables
         da zona -> servidor trata como destruídos e gera orbs
      2) ClaimOrb(zona, tier, dano, coinId) em todos os orbs
         da zona -> servidor credita moedas/rubis/gemas
    ============================================================
]]

